OL,3,GNEWSAAnalysis: Lockhart departure
OL,4,Apresents massive challenge for DUP and
OL,5,Aunionism
OL,6,
OL,7,FWithin minutes of her resignation
OL,8,Fletter being published online on
OL,9,FMonday, Carla Lockhart's photo and
OL,10,Fprofile were stripped from the DUP
OL,11,Fwebpage.
OL,13,FAll traces of one of the party's most
OL,14,Fpopular politicians were wiped away at
OL,15,Fbreakneck speed.
OL,17,FThe party she joined as a teenager
OL,18,Fwasted no time in moving on, issuing
OL,19,Fthe shortest of statements regretting
OL,20,Fher decision to quit but making it
OL,21,Fclear such divisions in unionism only
OL,22,Fbenefit Sinn Fein.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
